  "goodToKnow": "Die Handarbeit means handwork: in Handarbeit gefertigt (handmade, a quality selling point for German watches and crafts), and handicrafts like knitting, crochet and embroidery. Handarbeit used to be a school subject, mainly for girls, now often called Textiles Gestalten. It can also mean manual labour as opposed to Kopfarbeit (brainwork). Plural: die Handarbeiten."
